Feeziq Privacy Policy
Last Updated: June 20, 2025

Welcome to Feeziq! This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application (the "App"). Please read this policy carefully. If you do not agree with the terms of this privacy policy, please do not access the App.

1. Information We Collect
We collect information that you provide to us, that is generated automatically, and that you share as part of our community features.

a) Information You Provide Directly:

Account Information: When you create an account, we collect your name, email address, and password.

Profile & Fitness Data: You may provide information about your fitness goals, experience level, weight, height, and other related metrics.

User-Generated Content: We collect the workout routines, multi-day diet plans, meal logs, and messages you create and share within the App. This includes text, images, and any other data you input.

b) Information Collected Automatically:

Usage Data: We automatically track your interactions with the App, including completed workouts, calories burned, Experience Points (XP) earned, achievements unlocked, and feature usage.

Device Information: We may collect information about your mobile device, including device ID, model, and operating system.

c) Feeziq AI Companion:

When you interact with the Feeziq AI Companion, we process your questions and conversation history to provide you with accurate, personalized responses. We do not use this data to personally identify you outside of the context of improving the AI's performance and safety.

2. How We Use Your Information
We use the information we collect to operate, maintain, and enhance the Feeziq App.

To Provide and Personalize the Service: To manage your account, deliver your custom workout and diet plans, track your progress, and personalize your experience.

For Gamification: To calculate XP, award achievements, and power the motivational features of the App.

To Enable Social Features: To allow you to share your plans with the community, connect with friends, and use the chat feature.

To Power the AI Companion: To provide you with a responsive and intelligent AI coach for your health and fitness questions.

For Analytics and Improvement: To understand how our users interact with the App, troubleshoot issues, and develop new features.

To Communicate With You: To send you service-related announcements, updates, and support messages.

3. How We Share Your Information
We are committed to maintaining your trust, and we share your data only in the following circumstances:

With Other Users (As Directed by You): When you choose to share your workout or diet plans, they become visible to the Feeziq community. Your basic profile information may be visible to friends you connect with.

With Service Providers: We may share information with third-party vendors who perform services on our behalf, such as cloud hosting, data analytics, and AI processing. These providers are obligated to protect your data and use it only for the services they provide to us.

For Legal Reasons: We may disclose your information if required to do so by law or in the good faith belief that such action is necessary to comply with a legal obligation, protect our rights or property, or ensure the safety of our users.

4. Data Security
We implement administrative, technical, and physical security measures to help protect your personal information. While we have taken reasonable steps to secure the personal information you provide to us, please be aware that despite our efforts, no security measures are perfect or impenetrable.

5. Your Rights and Choices
You have control over your personal information.

Access and Update: You may review and change the information in your account at any time by logging into your account settings.

Data Deletion: You may request to delete your account and associated data by contacting us. We will make commercially reasonable efforts to delete your data, though we may retain certain information for legal or business purposes.

6. Children's Privacy
Our services are not directed to individuals under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that a child under 13 has provided us with personal information, we will take steps to delete such information.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date.

8. Contact Us
If you have questions or comments about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: support@feeziq.com
